      "id": "claim_14b2707882954cfe81127f89adf6e9d4",
      "statement": "The task worker persists only the ids of the attached MCP servers into tasks.mcpServerIds so the UI can render which MCP servers were attached, while the decrypted env and oauthClientSecret live only for the duration of the single agent invocation.",
